<section class="page"><div class="eyebrow small">HAMJAMIYAT NAZORATI</div><h1>Shikoyatlar</h1><p class="muted">Oddiy foydalanuvchi o‘zi yuborgan va o‘z e’loniga kelgan shikoyatlarni ko‘radi. Moderator shikoyatni tasdiqlasa, e’lon bloklanadi; rad etsa, holati saqlanadi.</p><div class="stack"><?php foreach($items as $x):?><article class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>#<?=$x['id']?> · <?=e($x['title'])?></h2><span class="status"><?=status_label($x['status'])?></span></div><p class="muted">Yuborgan: <?=e($x['author'])?> · <?=e($x['created_at'])?></p><p class="detail-description"><?=e($x['reason'])?></p><a class="text-button" href="<?=url('listing',['id'=>$x['listing_id']])?>">E’lonni ko‘rish →</a><?php if($x['outcome']):?><div class="notice">Qaror: <?=status_label($x['outcome'])?> · <?=e($x['moderator'])?><p><?=e($x['note'])?></p></div><?php elseif(in_array($user['role'],['admin','moderator'],true)):?><form class="app-form decision-form" method="post" action="<?=url('complaint-decide')?>" data-validate><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$x['id']?>"><label>Qaror<select name="outcome" required><option value="approved">Shikoyatni tasdiqlash — e’lonni bloklash</option><option value="rejected">Shikoyatni rad etish</option></select></label><label>Asoslangan izoh<textarea name="note" required minlength="10" maxlength="2000" rows="2"></textarea></label><button class="primary">Qarorni saqlash</button></form><?php endif?></article><?php endforeach?><?php if(!$items):?><div class="empty"><h2>Shikoyatlar yo‘q</h2><p>E’lonning batafsil sahifasidan shikoyat yuborish mumkin.</p></div><?php endif?></div></section>
